{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2216021a569e5d05ee9360ead06317cddca241b8f08b657b52b1573d8af78ed1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c385613b7cbfda2df3511bd630586ccbae625143219adec71748735a225fe159","slc_ff37b6766a595b7c741231358e56f97a96bf42a69924bb0808712e3c708d574a"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"The agent supports many LLM providers from one registry — Anthropic, OpenAI/Codex, Google Gemini/Vertex, OpenRouter, Groq, Mistral, Together, Fireworks, DeepSeek, Cerebras, Bedrock, GitHub Copilot, plus local models via Ollama.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_39129cf851bec6feea686110a067281614344a4fc4498b6affae232c4134aaca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e5ad5d81ece6d64c45911cc4428cfb8aadc8c5e3430818f17ab4117250bd7e3","slc_5a1504a87b8c837544c5870717796d246c0fce862b2c010bcded8906bdd80812","slc_6af835f0fb682d011f62ac744af8224ea96232d8d255d2b350c1c9cfb4ab4efe"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f","src_f3ec632d5330500eb001b8bb435d369b"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors run cargo fmt --all, cargo build, and cargo test; CI runs fmt, build, and tests on Linux and macOS with clippy advisory, and fmt is treated as a hard gate.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_40f14afbb5963c5b28f4e7f166b8f9262af9cb5302881db6a464ffda24591dcb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d6b320899e5b4246f42e2444a35cd7c2a9b2e14ae74c8dad05ec61249249b215"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"Built-in tools called autonomously in the agent loop include read/write/edit, bash, grep/find/ls/tree, hybrid BM25+semantic code_search, web_search/web_fetch, a task sub-agent spawner, and an opt-in computer tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_545317dd3eaa1072c408e37c1a38a844c81a14519918735d036f7a7fceef88fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a984ed4731f8e6351e36941c098ff7f12b6a55e651e717246b5d09582221bbe4","slc_f76b7aade3b0de11f63156c4cdf2c40025b9d7ff0bc5c836593494172617bb4f"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"The --orchestrate flag runs each given task as an independent sub-agent process in parallel and collects the results.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_863dd1715948e36c66c02042ae25f0c66b9459d7802f9066feb311d32ee6f979","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4a3d51fd6e304028f64a387b45a336da71b2326adcfc7d6dfa9f162b239b7788","slc_93f2991fc265b4616267aea63b170972ae638f0ae493eb4fd29485bef1fd1e0f","slc_e79d3bd803b5a809ce073f8f4a2f6069f2fba8748a89ab97314942ace5ddd73b"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"The agent ships 295 curated personas across 30 domains, each a markdown brief at personas/<division>/<id>.md; user-added .md files join the library without code changes, and personas are injected into the system prompt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_886300953789434820012f23e9ebf531b7a208f80f526dafa7d086ccded84ce1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3386e656957ebd815e3d408f7096104c1b4addb58ea8f308ab6152b2e739492e","slc_5521ba14d8cc151fc5a5bee2773b999174c8bbf6e15c56e42f5885ccc9f0c6b7"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"Memories are stored as plain markdown files with a MEMORY.md index that users can edit, and the agent treats user edits as truth; sub-agents never extract memories to avoid recursion.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ad9a0ff6b6e1ab57eb7b022bb83aa89f269b48140885f637d9bc6d884ffa98f8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_45e1dd2ecd3a2fcd950eb41297af947668febe155078a816bf85a9ecdcd7cdc0","slc_8848a36eac327835be475c2bbcc980d456341dce4278ebb44365dba273d334a7","slc_96def9816ad365b7934612194fb201f96302319199d0aca959ac7fdbd51d1dd7","slc_e4b9a5f05e9eb5c73b900e024cc4daba4f3565aed349c94d39fa4a454948bb51"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"An /interop toggle (off by default) lets the agent read Claude Code and Codex MCP-server and skill configs as-is, read-only, using only stdio servers and skipping disabled entries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c2a95d8cbae6aa5f551d5fa3228eb60c7c096beeb8b9a552d592b06dce5bdb26","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_544cbc13947fea93b1f2b1d6f23fd7e149b64ebc18955e6f3ce6e243cec806d2","slc_f5536e46841a2bb51fb1e1669d52e21fd34e85a5a9af64e92362dfc0d62288c4","slc_fca3b4b13a780d468b9a260943d8479f3ab4995b18993ebb689aead2c088588e"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"A per-project wiki stores markdown pages in a shared vault scoped per project, with get/set/list/search/delete actions, and mutating wiki actions are blocked in plan mode and under read-only personas.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cc1b26950ae3976bd5ce0545393c5a1df4c917f8dd1ccf912e10f6bdc6901884","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a3fd01f9d898b86ccd19cc90bcfc158448050a4310fc1d2a9c2bacd535e6bc06"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"bbarit-oss is a terminal-native AI coding agent CLI that reads, writes, and edits code, runs shell commands, and ships as a single static Rust binary with no runtime to install.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_daf19df9497a7f4e192d7217bffd7111d70db9189c524157b402c9168e3ec635","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52952a819ad53fe2cff29efda1cd3e8c221a8c89f8e8886bb01b1e924ac210e9","slc_f42c1027d93f96335333d7b7ea782c9f0f9b5b1bd58d73cf87fa82ba92431f79"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"Non-interactive modes include --print, where stdout carries only the final answer while narration goes to stderr, and --mode json, which streams newline-delimited JSON events for programmatic consumers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eeab7c0cdc6bce37b079f2d2836d6c821cd287ada12a72134fd4d2a6a22694ac","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c9be2f16c6ba9019bef2ea37d05c49d509baa8fa7c4d2b3702c8687783b24d3a","slc_f8e2b325c182c5fef9ebe069a4a192c471028cb99732aac8d95640858b31d0d3"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"The project is a from-scratch Rust rewrite of Pi (MIT), keeping Pi's small agent-loop philosophy and provider-agnostic registry while adding an orchestrator, wiki, personas, and semantic code search; it reports near-zero source overlap with Pi.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fe30cc7c849992853597789d7326ad6dbab30f982ee605925992e62db11ffe63","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss@2cb8b723f278 snapshot 193ffd7e172b4267","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_be300ea0a374d40990ab199892b31388860818322a8699e0cb2078fdbc1f55fe","slc_c6c8243744b29c06f3c6be64e48787015f8d94ef687717816bdc5bf805e6f727"],"source_ids":["src_d3be3296417550ee831e3d75febaf08f"],"text":"Tool access can be restricted with --tools/--exclude-tools/--no-tools, mutations can be gated behind project trust via --approve, and read-only personas refuse mutating tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_88aeff92b7b54c65a6517cc2833be3bc"}
